  "upload_type": "software",
  "title": "DiagHam",
  "description": "<p>DiagHam is an exact-diagonalization toolkit for strongly correlated quantum systems: the fractional quantum Hall effect, fractional Chern and topological insulators, Hubbard models, spin chains and quantum dots. This archive is a stable release of DiagHam with its CMake build, its ctest suite and its documentation. The DiagHam Subversion revision it carries is given in the release notes.</p>",
